  "description": {
    "raw": "Upon casting this spell, you permanently rearrange and resize the\nrooms in a building you constructed as a downtime activity (see\npage 84 of Ultimate Campaign). You may reorganize and remap\nthe building however you please, as if each room had just been\nconstructed and is being positioned for the first time. You cannot\nmake any changes to a building that changes how much a room\nwould cost to create or that alters the benefits a room provides.\nThe structure also must remain in the same general position\nwithin the district. If you don’t wholly own the structure, all of\nthe structure’s owners must consent to the changes being made\nbefore the spell is cast; otherwise, it fails immediately.",
    "search_text": "\"upon casting this spell, you permanently rearrange and resize the\\nrooms in a building you constructed as a downtime activity (see\\npage 84 of ultimate campaign). you may reorganize and remap\\nthe building however you please, as if each room had just been\\nconstructed and is being positioned for the first time. you cannot\\nmake any changes to a building that changes how much a room\\nwould cost to create or that alters the benefits a room provides.\\nthe structure also must remain in the same general position\\nwithin the district. if you don’t wholly own the structure, all of\\nthe structure’s owners must consent to the changes being made\\nbefore the spell is cast; otherwise, it fails immediately.\"",
    "sections": [],
    "document": {
      "node_type": "document",
      "content": [
        {
          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "Upon casting this spell, you permanently rearrange and resize the rooms in a building you constructed as a downtime activity (see page 84 of "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "Ultimate Campaign",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "). You may reorganize and remap the building however you please, as if each room had just been constructed and is being positioned for the first time. You cannot make any changes to a building that changes how much a room would cost to create or that alters the benefits a room provides. The structure also must remain in the same general position within the district. If you don’t wholly own the structure, all of the structure’s owners must consent to the changes being made before the spell is cast; otherwise, it fails immediately."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
